emergencyDrain
  ├── when the caller does not have the EMERGENCY_DRAINER_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when the caller has the EMERGENCY_DRAINER_ROLE
      ├── when the emergency drain delay has not been met
      │   └── it should revert
      └── when the emergency drain delay has been met
          ├── when the TVL is zero
          │   ├── it should not withdraw from the strategy
          │   ├── it should transfer all USDC to the caller
          │   └── it should emit an EmergencyDrainExecuted event
          └── when the TVL is greater than zero
              ├── it should withdraw all funds from the strategy
              ├── when the withdraw fails and revertOnFailure is true
              │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__WithdrawFailed
              └── when the withdraw fails and revertOnFailure is false
                  └── it should transfer all USDC to the caller
